        "synopsis": {
            "value": "Song Ha-Ran (Lee Sung-Kyung) is the chief designer of Korea's premier high-end fashion house Nana Atelier. Unlike her flawless, seemingly perfect image, she has locked herself in a winter state due to the loss of loved ones. Song Ha-Ran accidentally meets Sunwoo Chan (Chae Jong-Hyeop). This causes cracks in her daily life and the balance of her life begins to shake. Sunwoo Chan works as a character designer at a world famous animation studio. He has a bright and cheerful personality, but, behind that, he harbors deep wounds from a mysterious incident from his past. His accidental encounter with Song Ha-Ran leads him to face an unimaginable secret.",
            "source": "asianwiki",
            "source_link": "https://asianwiki.com/In_Your_Radiant_Season"
